    "# Task 6: Logistic Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "**The Goal**: Shift from predicting a continuous number to predicting a distinct category.\n",
    "\n",
    "**The Action**: Using the properly split and encoded dataset, train a Logistic Regression classifier to predict a binary outcome: 1 if a machinery state means \"Defective\" (Machine failure), and 0 if it is \"Good\".\n",
    "\n",
    "**The Research**: Generate a Confusion Matrix for the test set predictions. Analyze the real-world factory cost of a False Positive (throwing away a good part/stopping machine unnecessarily) versus a False Negative (shipping a broken part/ignoring a failing machine)."
   ]
  },
